<changelogs>
  <changelog>
    <element>mod_uk_dotnav</element>
    <type>module</type>
    <version>2.5</version>
    <addition>
      <item><![CDATA[Full Joomla 5/6 Architecture Implementation]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Modern Dispatcher Pattern for J5/6]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Namespaced Dispatcher (Joomlaplates\Module\UkDotnav)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Automatic detection: Works with AND without Compatibility Plugin]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Dual-mode support: Legacy (J3/4) and Modern (J5/6) side by side]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Joomla 5 and Joomla 6 compatibility (with and without compatibility plugin)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Based on core mod_articles patterns (ModuleHelper, layout in tmpl/); flat structure for compatibility plugin support]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Namespace updates: use Joomla\CMS\Helper\ModuleHelper]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[declare(strict_types=1) and modern PHP in mod_uk_dotnav.php and tmpl/default.php]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Module class suffix applied in layout; field type text (was textarea)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Manifest: version 2.5, language keys for all admin labels, formsource relative path]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Language files: MOD_UK_DOTNAV_* keys, LICENSE URL https]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Empty index.html in root, forms/, tmpl/, languages/, languages/en-GB/]]></item>
    </addition>
    <change>
      <item><![CDATA[Improved code structure and maintainability]]></item>
    </change>
    <fix>
      <item><![CDATA[Fixed typo authorUrl (joomaplates -&gt; joomlaplates)]]></item>
    </fix>
    <remove>
      <item><![CDATA[Removed unused params/vars from main file (slider/slidenav/velocity etc.)]]></item>
    </remove>
    <note>
      <item><![CDATA[Fully backward compatible - no breaking changes]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[Simple module - no Helper class needed]]></item>
    </note>
  </changelog>
